                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Somewhat usable now.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Still todo- fix include issue on gcc/unix - if you enable ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "//#include \"Stroika/Foundation/Containers/Concrete/DenseDataHyperRectangle_Vector.h\"",
                              "type" : "text"
                           },
                           {
                              "type" : "hardBreak"
                           },
                           {
                              "text" : "//#include \"Stroika/Foundation/Containers/Concrete/SparseDataHyperRectangle_stdmap.h\"",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "in Test13 .cpp file -= fails to build. Try trick with extra level of templates on function to delay eval.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "and no iterator support yet for dense (sparse probably somewhat usable).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "And sitll need to do some strategy for operator-> returning references, but in  a way that safe and we can detect races accessing dangling pointers (so returning smart ptr obj).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
